            }
           }
          ],
          "text": "Tetracyclines:"
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "attrs": {
         "indLeft": 36,
         "indRight": 0,
         "indFirst": -18,
         "spaceBefore": 0,
         "spaceAfter": 0,
         "line": {
          "rule": "auto",
          "value": 1
         },
         "align": "left",
         "shade": null,
         "borders": null,
         "marker": null
        },
        "content": [
         {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "-    Clin Use: alt for PCN-allergic pts across most guidelines - IDSA also lists doxycycline as gen alt to amoxicillin-clavulanate for any adult w acute bact rhinosinusitis"
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "attrs": {
         "indLeft": 36,
         "indRight": 0,
         "indFirst": -18,
         "spaceBefore": 0,
         "spaceAfter": 0,
         "line": {
          "rule": "auto",
          "value": 1
         },
         "align": "left",
         "shade": null,
         "borders": null,
         "marker": null
        },
        "content": [
         {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "-    Also: MRSA coverage (cellulitis: TMP-SMX · doxycycline · clindamycin) - tick-borne dz (Lyme: doxycycline · amoxicillin · cefuroxime - RMSF: doxycycline · chloramphenicol) - syphilis (doxycycline · tetracycline = alt) - acne (doxycycline + minocycline = MC PO abx - doxycycline over azithro) - blepharitis (PO tetracyclines reserved for severe · refractory cases)"
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "attrs": {
         "indLeft": 36,
         "indRight": 0,
         "indFirst": -18,
         "spaceBefore": 0,
         "spaceAfter": 0,
         "line": {
          "rule": "auto",
          "value": 1
         },
         "align": "left",
         "shade": null,
         "borders": null,
         "marker": null
        },
        "content": [
         {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "-    RMSF: doxycycline = tx of choice @ all ages - even children <8y (short courses approved despite dental staining) & preg - chloramphenicol ⍉longer preferred (3rd TM → gray baby syndrome)"
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "attrs": {
         "indLeft": 0,
         "indRight": 0,
         "indFirst": 0,
         "spaceBefore": 0,
         "spaceAfter": 0,
         "line": null,
         "align": "left",
         "shade": null,
         "borders": null,
         "marker": null
        },
        "content": [
         {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "-    Atypical PNA (M. pneumoniae · Chlamydophila · Coxiella · Legionella): doxycycline or tetracycline (alts: macrolides · FQs)"
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "attrs": {
         "indLeft": 0,
         "indRight": 0,
         "indFirst": 0,
         "spaceBefore": 0,
         "spaceAfter": 0,
         "line": null,
         "align": "left",
         "shade": null,
         "borders": null,
         "marker": null
        },
        "content": [
         {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "-    CAP, outpt: doxycycline monotx (healthy pts) - w comorbid → doxycycline + Augmentin or cephalosporin"
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "attrs": {
         "indLeft": 0,
         "indRight": 0,
         "indFirst": 0,
         "spaceBefore": 0,
         "spaceAfter": 0,
         "line": null,
         "align": "left",
         "shade": null,
         "borders": null,
         "marker": null
        },
        "content": [
         {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "-    GU/STI (doxycycline): chlamydia/NGU 100mg BID x7d (+ ceftriaxone 500mg IM x1 if GC ⍉excluded) - epididymitis w STI risk 100mg BID x10d + ceftriaxone - acute prostatitis (sexually active) + ceftriaxone"
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "attrs": {
         "indLeft": 0,
         "indRight": 0,
         "indFirst": 0,
         "spaceBefore": 0,
         "spaceAfter": 0,
